{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118847771100737536"]}, "author_id": "184601220", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:27:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118847796778537376"], "id": "2118847796778537376", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "¿Un chat eterno por cada proyecto? 🗂️\n\nMeta Muse Spaces (hoy 6 nov): describes la idea y Muse te arma un Space — tracker, planner o tablero — y lo actualiza con tus apps.\n\nApp Muse → describe → abre el Space en la barra. https://t.co/9fGk5uspWK", "url": "https://x.com/MDALatam/status/2118847796778537376"}, {"article": {"title": "AI𝕏巡回 朝刊 2026.11.07｜OpenAI「BioBasicsBench」、湿式実験100題でAstra 66.7%"}, "author_id": "929909588706541568", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:24:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118846996769313160"], "id": "2118846996769313160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/tJ0Bic9zE2", "url": "https://x.com/bunkeideploy/status/2118846996769313160"}, {"article": {"title": "Museに任せて得した事例・つまずいた事例14選｜先に使った人のケースで分かった分かれ目"}, "author_id": "2013598367801319425", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:23:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118846755899121931"], "id": "2118846755899121931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/WyKcXR3Fu2", "url": "https://x.com/K_AI_Work/status/2118846755899121931"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118846549568450560", "3_2118846549555859456"]}, "author_id": "1897779361178148864", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:22:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118846557990605238"], "id": "2118846557990605238", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1897779361178148864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118846513937838460", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Revolut @finkd ⚔️ GROKBOT – META-BESCHWERDE / E-MAIL-RECHERCHE\n\nPriorität: HOCH – nur lesend arbeiten\n\nZiel: Frühere Beschwerden und Supportkontakte mit Meta aus September und Oktober 2026 wiederfinden.\n\nAufgaben:\n\n1. In bereits autorisierten E-Mail-Postfächern nach Meta, Muse Code, Meta Model https://t.co/JpHkSKVKmv", "url": "https://x.com/binancechiller/status/2118846557990605238"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118846280969662464"]}, "author_id": "1481959802721153029", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:21:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118846307544740245"], "id": "2118846307544740245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰【小灯AI日报】新闻早知道📰11/7/2026\n\n🔥11月6日AI热点新闻汇总:👇\n\n这一天，腾讯把混元推到能看图、能自己操作软件；跨过太平洋，Anthropic 的招股书先亮出 5.67 亿美元季度亏损。\n\n🇨🇳 中文 AI 资讯\n\n1️⃣ 【腾讯 Hy4 上线，能看图操作软件】\n腾讯正式发布混元 https://t.co/zI4ElaZ5xN", "url": "https://x.com/SUPARLUXI/status/2118846307544740245"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118846269116350464"]}, "author_id": "163900253", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:21:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118846272639476084"], "id": "2118846272639476084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "80.52 on TerminalBench 2.1. That score belongs to Ripple-65B Preview, a 65B dense model from Ricursive. And it clears open models all the way up to 975B parameters. Reflection Beam 501B sits at 80.1. Meta Muse Spark Open 816B at 76.4. A two-burner cooktop out-plating a full line https://t.co/PJqwNj4eoj", "url": "https://x.com/bobm67/status/2118846272639476084"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118845865922023424"]}, "author_id": "17065524", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:20:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845873819992219", "2118846020927029715"], "id": "2118846020927029715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal AI agents finally have a pricing table that is not a press release.\n\nI put live starting prices for Grok Bot, Dots, Meta Muse, Manus, Lindy, plus open-source OpenClaw and Hermes Agent, on one page.\n\nGrok Bot from $30/mo. Dots rides ChatGPT plans from $100/mo. Several https://t.co/C4XVldcoFK", "url": "https://x.com/Stan_Timek/status/2118846020927029715"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118845865922023424"]}, "author_id": "17065524", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:19:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845873819992219", "2118846020927029715"], "id": "2118845873819992219", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal AI agents finally have a pricing table that is not a press release.\n\nI put live starting prices for Grok Bot, Dots, Meta Muse, Manus, Lindy, plus open-source OpenClaw and Hermes Agent, on one page.\n\nGrok Bot from $30/mo. Dots rides ChatGPT plans from $100/mo. Several https://t.co/wOTBtqLy4I", "url": "https://x.com/Stan_Timek/status/2118845873819992219"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118845834389524480"]}, "author_id": "245452616", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:19:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845841113067574"], "id": "2118845841113067574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta’s Muse Can Now Build Custom Spaces From a Description: Meta is adding a feature called spaces to its Muse AI agent, letting users describe a tool they want and have Muse build it inside the app. The… www.​iphoneincanada.​ca/2026/11/06/meta-muse-spaces-custom-experiences/ https://t.co/jFqknTRau0", "url": "https://x.com/iFixMalaga/status/2118845841113067574"}, {"author_id": "4256638398", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:19:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845687253410142"], "id": "2118845687253410142", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "muse\n\nパーソナルエージェントMeta muse \n招待コードを登録して、48時間以内に使用すると、招待した側、された側に、10億museトークンがもらえる。\n\nお使いください。返信不要。\n（定員30人に達したら使用不可になります。）\n\n【招待コード】：UEQ2GT", "url": "https://x.com/syonerin/status/2118845687253410142"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2118844440475205632"]}, "author_id": "1902887712073584642", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:14:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118844503821852906"], "id": "2118844503821852906", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse builds mini apps now. I described a holiday gift tracker and had a working page about 3 minutes later. Then I asked for a total budget and a festive look and it rebuilt it. Sharing isn't shipped yet tho. Full breakdown on my YouTube https://t.co/fXN6RBOu3j", "url": "https://x.com/JaySym_/status/2118844503821852906"}, {"author_id": "1274691", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:10:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118843601606349231"], "id": "2118843601606349231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Metaは米国時間11/6、Muse Wonderの知見で訓練した特化モデルを、MuseとMeta AIに展開すると発表した。\n会話の内容を覚えるActive Memoryと、目標に沿って作業を続けるActive Focusを取り入れる。\nActive Memoryは過去の会話から今も有効な情報を見分け、一時的な内容と残すべき内容を分けて扱う。", "url": "https://x.com/multilayer/status/2118843601606349231"}, {"author_id": "1274691", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:09:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118843219614322946"], "id": "2118843219614322946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Metaは米国時間11/6、Museアプリに、自分用の画面やミニ体験を作れる「Spaces」を追加した。\n旅行の計画や買い物のまとめ、日替わりの単語ゲームまで、やりたいことを伝えるとMuseが形にしてくれる。", "url": "https://x.com/multilayer/status/2118843219614322946"}, {"author_id": "5752822", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:58:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118840590561587533"], "id": "2118840590561587533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1Password for Meta Muse: Secure AI Login | 1Password\nhttps://t.co/ttePQByJiR", "url": "https://x.com/haruka_yj/status/2118840590561587533"}, {"author_id": "1980669253352382464", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:40:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118836060256112933"], "id": "2118836060256112933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Metaが、AIのMuseとテーマ別に相談できる「Spaces」を始めました。旅行計画などを裏で更新し続けるそうです。案件ごとの部屋として使えそうですね。整理役は助かりますね。\n#Meta #Muse #AIエージェント", "url": "https://x.com/mawatetsu1030/status/2118836060256112933"}, {"author_id": "1234586881544736768", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:40:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118835874511421644"], "id": "2118835874511421644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok AIデイリー｜API文章透かしが既定オン、CoforgeがPartner Network参加、Grok BotとMeta Museの料金比較\n\n▶ 動画 https://t.co/uj8nyBHHvt\n📰 記事 https://t.co/JCIa1jdpjU", "url": "https://x.com/minoru0707_ai/status/2118835874511421644"}, {"author_id": "1049241654761119744", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:33:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118834226636419465"], "id": "2118834226636419465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 2147, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "【11月7日 朝のニュースまとめ】\n・Anthropic、Claudeの記憶を整理するdreamingを解説\n・Claude Codeクラウド環境、依存やAPIキーを自動構成\n・Anthropic、相場急落でもIPO続行し来週ロードショー\n・TSMC、Nvidiaの要請で3D DRAM製造を検討\n・Meta Muse、Spaces追加とWonder由来の特化モデル導入", "url": "https://x.com/MLBear2/status/2118834226636419465"}, {"article": {"title": "Meta Muse、旅行や行事の管理を専用タブに"}, "author_id": "1829891399980105730", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:30:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118833344355979278"], "id": "2118833344355979278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 231, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/0jPcP2JsCX", "url": "https://x.com/yasu_ai_journey/status/2118833344355979278"}, {"author_id": "2059782307893141504", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:29:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118833159324475607"], "id": "2118833159324475607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 158, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日AI新闻精简版\n\n1、市场与基建\n    中期选举后民主党胜选，市场担忧数据中心受限，AI股暴跌。Nasdaq 100单日蒸发约2.3万亿美元（跌约5.5%–6.4%），亚洲跟跌。OpenAI宣布新政策：自担100%电费与基建成本、取消对官员NDA、公开用水用电数据。\n\n2、OpenAI\n       发布**GPT-6", "url": "https://x.com/ulgqob/status/2118833159324475607"}, {"author_id": "2085938493059145728", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:22:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118831363889770834"], "id": "2118831363889770834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118768974779634084", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Metaが、Muse Wonderで鍛えた専門モデルをMuseとMeta AIに広げた。\n大事なことを忘れにくくし、行き詰まりから立ち直る力が上がったという。\n長い会話でも、ゴールを見失わず進めやすくなる。\nそばにいる相手が、もう一段頼りになる感じだ。\n日々のやりとりが、すこし温かくつながっていく。\n\n#AI https://t.co/u1eC3mFhS4", "url": "https://x.com/yoshinoakiya/status/2118831363889770834"}, {"author_id": "147842166", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:18:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118830381617008971"], "id": "2118830381617008971", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1551048678932103170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118374309303345202", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@EliorTam Muse invite code for you: 4DJ3O4 — redeem within 48h of creating your account (Settings → Redeem token / Redeem invite code). 1B tokens each. #MuseAI #MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/JRobertge/status/2118830381617008971"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118830269939822592"]}, "author_id": "711777491564638209", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:17:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118830274167681464"], "id": "2118830274167681464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118489527362912566", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "11月7日のAIニュースまとめ\n\n・Thinking Machines\nInkling 2 Smallを公開\nAA Intelligence Indexで31点\nTinkerで微調整と推論が可能\n\n・OpenAI\nGPT-5.6 SolのUltrafastを非推奨化\n12月7日から標準帯へ自動フォールバック\nGPT-6.1 SolとGPT-6 AstraはUltrafast継続\nhttps://t.co/27TouExd7y https://t.co/KrEugPYvGw https://t.co/8CCjf1NNog", "url": "https://x.com/masa_aicoding/status/2118830274167681464"}, {"author_id": "147842166", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:17:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118830269184561258"], "id": "2118830269184561258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Muse AI invite code: 4DJ3O4\n\nCómo canjearlo:\n1. Entra a https://t.co/gwc2gwane7\n2. Dentro de las primeras 48 h: Settings → Redeem token (app) o Settings → General → Usage → Redeem invite code (web)\n3. Pega: 4DJ3O4\n\nAmbos recibimos 1B de tokens 🙌\n\n#MuseAI #MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/JRobertge/status/2118830269184561258"}, {"author_id": "953822116335509504", "created_at": "2026-